Error [jet.DestructureShapeMismatch]: `start` isn't a member of (low: Int, high: Int)
  --> tests/ui/tuple_destructure_by_position.jet:4:6
    |
  4 |     (start, end): bounds()
    |      ^^^^^
 Why: A tuple destructure binds each member by its name, never by position
 Fix: Name the members, `(low, high): …`, or rename them: `{ low: start, high: end }: …`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0313
